* Hello, World for MIX
* Prints "HELLO" using OUT instruction (device 19 = paper tape punch / stdout in MDK)
TERM    EQU     19          * terminal device number
        ORIG    3000
START   OUT     MSG(TERM)   * print message
        HLT
MSG     ALF     "HELLO"
        ALF     " WORL"
        ALF     "D    "
        END     START
